  "bodyHash": "PtXk3FRfHtM=",
  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">深渊深处为Minecraft的深海添加了一种新生物，名为：莫斯。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">莫斯拥有200点生命值，随时在Minecraft的深海中生成。莫斯死亡时会掉落两颗巨大的牙齿。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他的牙齿可以用来制作一把非常强大的牙齿剑。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N8be40a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1577\" height=\"665\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xjT1MCQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"859\" height=\"288\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
